1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,264
Nine hundred and fifty years.

2
00:00:02,264 --> 00:00:03,460
That is how long

3
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,714
one prophet lived

4
00:00:04,714 --> 00:00:05,944
among his people,

5
00:00:05,944 --> 00:00:07,814
calling them to Allah.

6
00:00:07,814 --> 00:00:09,706
This is the story of Nuh,

7
00:00:09,706 --> 00:00:11,331
peace be upon him,

8
00:00:11,331 --> 00:00:12,074
told the way

9
00:00:12,074 --> 00:00:13,688
the Quran tells it.

10
00:00:13,688 --> 00:00:15,279
On the Day of Judgment,

11
00:00:15,279 --> 00:00:16,161
people will come

12
00:00:16,161 --> 00:00:17,636
to Nuh and say:

13
00:00:17,636 --> 00:00:18,773
You are the first

14
00:00:18,773 --> 00:00:19,679
of the messengers

15
00:00:19,679 --> 00:00:21,479
to the people of the earth.

16
00:00:21,479 --> 00:00:22,198
That is

17
00:00:22,198 --> 00:00:22,953
in a hadith

18
00:00:22,953 --> 00:00:24,404
of the Prophet Muhammad,

19
00:00:24,404 --> 00:00:25,554
peace and blessings

20
00:00:25,554 --> 00:00:26,587
be upon him,

21
00:00:26,587 --> 00:00:28,607
in Sahih al-Bukhari.

22
00:00:28,607 --> 00:00:29,466
Among the people

23
00:00:29,466 --> 00:00:30,198
of Nuh

24
00:00:30,198 --> 00:00:31,997
there were righteous men.

25
00:00:31,997 --> 00:00:33,530
When those men died,

26
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:34,470
Satan whispered

27
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,434
to the people:

28
00:00:35,434 --> 00:00:36,722
Set up statues where

29
00:00:36,722 --> 00:00:37,721
they used to sit,

30
00:00:37,721 --> 00:00:39,962
and call them by their names.

31
00:00:39,962 --> 00:00:41,355
Ibn Abbas,

32
00:00:41,355 --> 00:00:42,063
may Allah

33
00:00:42,063 --> 00:00:43,236
be pleased with him,

34
00:00:43,236 --> 00:00:44,246
explained it,

35
00:00:44,246 --> 00:00:46,928
as Sahih al-Bukhari records.

36
00:00:46,928 --> 00:00:47,810
At first,

37
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:48,796
no one worshipped

38
00:00:48,796 --> 00:00:50,131
the statues.

39
00:00:50,131 --> 00:00:52,221
But the generations passed,

40
00:00:52,221 --> 00:00:53,905
the knowledge was forgotten,

41
00:00:53,905 --> 00:00:55,066
and then the statues

42
00:00:55,066 --> 00:00:56,169
were worshipped.

43
00:00:56,169 --> 00:00:57,539
Their names were Wadd,

44
00:00:57,539 --> 00:00:58,874
Suwa, Yaghuth,

45
00:00:58,874 --> 00:01:00,488
Yauq and Nasr.

46
00:01:00,488 --> 00:01:01,950
And Allah sent Nuh

47
00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:02,763
to his people

48
00:01:02,763 --> 00:01:04,284
with one message.

49
00:01:04,284 --> 00:01:05,271
He said:

50
00:01:05,271 --> 00:01:06,479
O my people,

51
00:01:06,479 --> 00:01:07,756
worship Allah.

52
00:01:07,756 --> 00:01:08,870
You have no god

53
00:01:08,870 --> 00:01:10,031
other than Him.

54
00:01:10,031 --> 00:01:10,647
I fear

55
00:01:10,647 --> 00:01:11,912
for you the punishment

56
00:01:11,912 --> 00:01:13,596
of a tremendous day.

57
00:01:13,596 --> 00:01:14,199
The leaders

58
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:15,430
of his people said:

59
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:17,787
We see you in clear error.

60
00:01:17,787 --> 00:01:18,785
Nuh said:

61
00:01:18,785 --> 00:01:21,061
There is no error in me.

62
00:01:21,061 --> 00:01:22,163
I am a messenger

63
00:01:22,163 --> 00:01:24,021
from the Lord of the worlds.

64
00:01:24,021 --> 00:01:26,494
He called them night and day.

65
00:01:26,494 --> 00:01:28,027
But every call only

66
00:01:28,027 --> 00:01:30,151
made them run further away.

67
00:01:30,151 --> 00:01:31,637
Every time he invited

68
00:01:31,637 --> 00:01:33,088
them to be forgiven,

69
00:01:33,088 --> 00:01:34,366
they put their fingers

70
00:01:34,366 --> 00:01:35,677
in their ears.

71
00:01:35,677 --> 00:01:36,920
They covered themselves

72
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,289
with their garments.

73
00:01:38,289 --> 00:01:39,392
They insisted,

74
00:01:39,392 --> 00:01:41,320
and they grew more arrogant.

75
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,794
So he called them openly,

76
00:01:42,794 --> 00:01:43,468
and he spoke

77
00:01:43,468 --> 00:01:44,721
to them in private.

78
00:01:44,721 --> 00:01:45,406
He said:

79
00:01:45,406 --> 00:01:47,531
Ask forgiveness of your Lord.

80
00:01:47,531 --> 00:01:49,249
He is ever forgiving.

81
00:01:49,249 --> 00:01:50,341
He will send rain

82
00:01:50,341 --> 00:01:51,060
from the sky

83
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,477
upon you in showers,

84
00:01:52,477 --> 00:01:53,498
and give you wealth

85
00:01:53,498 --> 00:01:54,183
and children,

86
00:01:54,183 --> 00:01:56,041
and gardens and rivers.

87
00:01:56,041 --> 00:01:56,854
He said:

88
00:01:56,854 --> 00:01:57,875
Do you not see

89
00:01:57,875 --> 00:01:59,118
how Allah created

90
00:01:59,118 --> 00:02:01,382
seven heavens in layers?

91
00:02:01,382 --> 00:02:02,334
He made the moon

92
00:02:02,334 --> 00:02:03,332
a light in them,

93
00:02:03,332 --> 00:02:05,608
and the sun a burning lamp.

94
00:02:05,608 --> 00:02:07,500
But the leaders only mocked.

95
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:08,522
They said:

96
00:02:08,522 --> 00:02:09,230
You are only

97
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:10,681
a man like us.

98
00:02:10,681 --> 00:02:11,633
And the only ones

99
00:02:11,633 --> 00:02:12,284
who follow

100
00:02:12,284 --> 00:02:14,408
you are the lowest of us.

101
00:02:14,408 --> 00:02:15,325
Nuh said:

102
00:02:15,325 --> 00:02:17,357
I ask you for no payment.

103
00:02:17,357 --> 00:02:19,679
My reward is only from Allah.

104
00:02:19,679 --> 00:02:20,329
And I will

105
00:02:20,329 --> 00:02:22,823
not drive away the believers.

106
00:02:22,823 --> 00:02:23,659
They said:

107
00:02:23,659 --> 00:02:24,390
O Nuh,

108
00:02:24,390 --> 00:02:25,749
you have argued with us,

109
00:02:25,749 --> 00:02:27,583
and argued too much.

110
00:02:27,583 --> 00:02:28,349
So bring us

111
00:02:28,349 --> 00:02:29,789
what you threaten us with,

112
00:02:29,789 --> 00:02:31,484
if you are truthful.

113
00:02:31,484 --> 00:02:33,051
Then they said:

114
00:02:33,051 --> 00:02:34,514
If you do not stop,

115
00:02:34,514 --> 00:02:35,362
O Nuh,

116
00:02:35,362 --> 00:02:37,347
you will surely be stoned.

117
00:02:37,347 --> 00:02:39,344
And they called him a madman.

118
00:02:39,344 --> 00:02:40,772
Year after year,

119
00:02:40,772 --> 00:02:42,664
only a few believed.

120
00:02:42,664 --> 00:02:45,230
Then Allah revealed to Nuh:

121
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:46,078
No one else

122
00:02:46,078 --> 00:02:46,891
from your people

123
00:02:46,891 --> 00:02:47,819
will believe,

124
00:02:47,819 --> 00:02:48,295
except

125
00:02:48,295 --> 00:02:50,002
those who already have.

126
00:02:50,002 --> 00:02:51,024
So do not grieve

127
00:02:51,024 --> 00:02:52,707
over what they do.

128
00:02:52,707 --> 00:02:54,565
And Allah commanded him:

129
00:02:54,565 --> 00:02:55,900
Build the ship under

130
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:56,713
Our watch

131
00:02:56,713 --> 00:02:58,640
and Our inspiration.

132
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:00,625
So Nuh built the ship,

133
00:03:00,625 --> 00:03:02,726
of planks and nails.

134
00:03:02,726 --> 00:03:04,247
And every time the leaders

135
00:03:04,247 --> 00:03:06,105
of his people passed by,

136
00:03:06,105 --> 00:03:07,707
they laughed at him.

137
00:03:07,707 --> 00:03:08,543
He said:

138
00:03:08,543 --> 00:03:09,936
If you laugh at us,

139
00:03:09,936 --> 00:03:11,527
we will laugh at you,

140
00:03:11,527 --> 00:03:13,257
just as you laugh.

141
00:03:13,257 --> 00:03:14,127
And you will come

142
00:03:14,127 --> 00:03:15,846
to know who will receive

143
00:03:15,846 --> 00:03:16,786
a punishment

144
00:03:16,786 --> 00:03:18,864
that disgraces him.

145
00:03:18,864 --> 00:03:19,967
Then the command

146
00:03:19,967 --> 00:03:21,337
of Allah came.

147
00:03:21,337 --> 00:03:23,682
And the oven overflowed.

148
00:03:23,682 --> 00:03:25,052
Allah said:

149
00:03:25,052 --> 00:03:26,271
Load onto the ship

150
00:03:26,271 --> 00:03:27,862
two of every kind,

151
00:03:27,862 --> 00:03:29,696
a male and a female,

152
00:03:29,696 --> 00:03:31,055
and your family,

153
00:03:31,055 --> 00:03:32,471
except those against whom

154
00:03:32,471 --> 00:03:33,133
the word has

155
00:03:33,133 --> 00:03:34,607
already gone out.

156
00:03:34,607 --> 00:03:36,650
And take those who believe.

157
00:03:36,650 --> 00:03:37,719
And only a few

158
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:39,112
believed with him.

159
00:03:39,112 --> 00:03:40,191
Nuh said:

160
00:03:40,191 --> 00:03:41,051
Board it.

161
00:03:41,051 --> 00:03:41,712
In the name

162
00:03:41,712 --> 00:03:42,339
of Allah

163
00:03:42,339 --> 00:03:43,198
is its sailing

164
00:03:43,198 --> 00:03:44,348
and its anchoring.

165
00:03:44,348 --> 00:03:45,741
My Lord is forgiving

166
00:03:45,741 --> 00:03:46,902
and merciful.

167
00:03:46,902 --> 00:03:47,726
Then the gates

168
00:03:47,726 --> 00:03:48,922
of the sky opened,

169
00:03:48,922 --> 00:03:51,070
with water pouring down.

170
00:03:51,070 --> 00:03:51,895
And the earth

171
00:03:51,895 --> 00:03:53,474
burst with springs.

172
00:03:53,474 --> 00:03:54,913
And the waters met,

173
00:03:54,913 --> 00:03:57,340
for a matter already decreed.

174
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:58,303
The ship sailed

175
00:03:58,303 --> 00:03:59,174
with them through

176
00:03:59,174 --> 00:04:01,264
waves like mountains.

177
00:04:01,264 --> 00:04:02,448
It sailed under

178
00:04:02,448 --> 00:04:03,911
the watch of Allah.

179
00:04:03,911 --> 00:04:05,571
And Nuh called to his son,

180
00:04:05,571 --> 00:04:07,173
who was standing apart:

181
00:04:07,173 --> 00:04:08,322
O my son,

182
00:04:08,322 --> 00:04:09,704
come aboard with us,

183
00:04:09,704 --> 00:04:10,157
and do

184
00:04:10,157 --> 00:04:12,212
not be with the disbelievers.

185
00:04:12,212 --> 00:04:13,489
His son said:

186
00:04:13,489 --> 00:04:15,114
I will go to a mountain.

187
00:04:15,114 --> 00:04:16,275
It will protect me

188
00:04:16,275 --> 00:04:17,796
from the water.

189
00:04:17,796 --> 00:04:18,829
Nuh said:

190
00:04:18,829 --> 00:04:20,989
Today there is no protector

191
00:04:20,989 --> 00:04:22,893
from the decree of Allah,

192
00:04:22,893 --> 00:04:23,648
except for

193
00:04:23,648 --> 00:04:25,958
the one He has mercy on.

194
00:04:25,958 --> 00:04:28,559
And a wave came between them.

195
00:04:28,559 --> 00:04:30,684
And he was among the drowned.

196
00:04:30,684 --> 00:04:32,030
Then it was said:

197
00:04:32,030 --> 00:04:32,994
O earth,

198
00:04:32,994 --> 00:04:34,318
swallow your water.

199
00:04:34,318 --> 00:04:35,293
O sky,

200
00:04:35,293 --> 00:04:37,185
hold back your rain.

201
00:04:37,185 --> 00:04:38,938
And the water sank away,

202
00:04:38,938 --> 00:04:40,715
and the matter was done.

203
00:04:40,715 --> 00:04:41,585
The ship came

204
00:04:41,585 --> 00:04:43,513
to rest on al-Judi.

205
00:04:43,513 --> 00:04:44,802
And it was said:

206
00:04:44,802 --> 00:04:46,520
Away with the wrongdoing

207
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:47,902
people.

208
00:04:47,902 --> 00:04:49,620
Nuh called to his Lord.

209
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:50,108
He said:

210
00:04:50,108 --> 00:04:50,978
My Lord,

211
00:04:50,978 --> 00:04:53,149
my son is of my family.

212
00:04:53,149 --> 00:04:54,914
And Your promise is true,

213
00:04:54,914 --> 00:04:55,378
and You

214
00:04:55,378 --> 00:04:57,967
are the most just of judges.

215
00:04:57,967 --> 00:04:59,024
Allah said:

216
00:04:59,024 --> 00:04:59,895
O Nuh,

217
00:04:59,895 --> 00:05:01,949
he is not of your family.

218
00:05:01,949 --> 00:05:03,853
His deeds were not righteous.

219
00:05:03,853 --> 00:05:04,852
So do not ask

220
00:05:04,852 --> 00:05:05,328
Me about

221
00:05:05,328 --> 00:05:05,978
what you have

222
00:05:05,978 --> 00:05:07,476
no knowledge of.

223
00:05:07,476 --> 00:05:08,462
Nuh said:

224
00:05:08,462 --> 00:05:09,229
My Lord,

225
00:05:09,229 --> 00:05:10,390
I seek refuge

226
00:05:10,390 --> 00:05:11,969
in You from asking what I

227
00:05:11,969 --> 00:05:13,571
have no knowledge of.

228
00:05:13,571 --> 00:05:14,848
Unless You forgive me

229
00:05:14,848 --> 00:05:16,450
and have mercy on me,

230
00:05:16,450 --> 00:05:18,238
I will be among the losers.

231
00:05:18,238 --> 00:05:19,527
And it was said:

232
00:05:19,527 --> 00:05:20,398
O Nuh,

233
00:05:20,398 --> 00:05:22,093
come down in peace from Us,

234
00:05:22,093 --> 00:05:23,556
with blessings on you,

235
00:05:23,556 --> 00:05:24,612
and on the nations

236
00:05:24,612 --> 00:05:26,632
from those who are with you.

237
00:05:26,632 --> 00:05:27,747
Allah saved him

238
00:05:27,747 --> 00:05:29,314
and the people of the ship,

239
00:05:29,314 --> 00:05:29,813
and made

240
00:05:29,813 --> 00:05:32,043
it a sign for all the worlds.

241
00:05:32,043 --> 00:05:32,925
And Allah left

242
00:05:32,925 --> 00:05:33,714
for him a good

243
00:05:33,714 --> 00:05:34,515
mention among

244
00:05:34,515 --> 00:05:36,303
later generations:

245
00:05:36,303 --> 00:05:37,615
Peace upon Nuh

246
00:05:37,615 --> 00:05:39,217
among the worlds.

247
00:05:39,217 --> 00:05:39,612
He was

248
00:05:39,612 --> 00:05:40,529
one of Allah's

249
00:05:40,529 --> 00:05:41,957
believing servants.

250
00:05:41,957 --> 00:05:43,408
And on the Day of Judgment,

251
00:05:43,408 --> 00:05:44,848
Nuh will be asked:

252
00:05:44,848 --> 00:05:46,810
Did you deliver the message?

253
00:05:46,810 --> 00:05:48,273
He will say: Yes,

254
00:05:48,273 --> 00:05:48,993
my Lord.

255
00:05:48,993 --> 00:05:50,421
His people will say:

256
00:05:50,421 --> 00:05:52,302
No prophet came to us.

257
00:05:52,302 --> 00:05:53,985
Then Nuh will be asked:

258
00:05:53,985 --> 00:05:56,040
Who will testify for you?

259
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,700
He will say: Muhammad,

260
00:05:57,700 --> 00:05:58,954
peace and blessings

261
00:05:58,954 --> 00:05:59,941
be upon him,

262
00:05:59,941 --> 00:06:01,334
and his nation.

263
00:06:01,334 --> 00:06:02,739
And they will testify

264
00:06:02,739 --> 00:06:03,621
that he delivered

265
00:06:03,621 --> 00:06:04,608
the message.

266
00:06:04,608 --> 00:06:07,232
That is in Sahih al-Bukhari.

267
00:06:07,232 --> 00:06:08,799
Nine hundred and fifty

268
00:06:08,799 --> 00:06:10,413
years of patience.

269
00:06:10,413 --> 00:06:11,551
The ship stands

270
00:06:11,551 --> 00:06:12,317
as a sign

271
00:06:12,317 --> 00:06:14,337
for anyone who will remember.

272
00:06:14,337 --> 00:06:16,752
That is the story of Nuh.
